              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata ngera saki Wasiria werechieghe na ijeshi ja wandu watinieri, ela BWANA orewinekieghe kusima ijeshi ja Juda ibaa nandighi weremsighieghe BWANA, uo Mlungu wa weke ndee. Kwa chia iyo, ijeshi ja Siria jikakatisha ikabo ja Joashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji Wasiria waghenda, wikamsigha Joashi washoghonolwa nandighi. Wikam'bwagha uko wulinyi kwake, angu orem'bwaghieghe mwana wa mkohani Jehoiada. Kwa huwo ukafwa, nawo wikamrika mzinyi kwa Daudi; ela ndeweremrikieghe andenyi ya makaburi gha wazuri anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu werem'bonyereghe njama ni Zabadi mwana wa Shimeathi muka wa Kiamoni, na Jehozabadi mwana wa Shimrithi muka wa Kimoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malagho gha wana wake, na madedo ghighorelo aighu yake, na gha kuboisa nyumba ya Mlungu, ghaandikilo andenyi ya Mawonyero gha Chuo cha Wazuri. Nao mwana wake Amazia ukabonya nguma wulalo ghwake.",
          "type": "text",
